###########################################################################
# CFC BOSS LOOT DROP-OFF
# Author: Dessan
# Version: 1.0, updated 2026-10-20
# Empties your backpack and the CFC Public Chest into the guild distros and
# storage, then starts [bossresults and opens Distro One for you to hand out.
# Based on the YEW boss loot drop-off by Stephanius, adapted from a script by Templer.
#
# Where the loot goes:
#   rares, rare cloth, maps, gold  -> Distro One (Distro Two when One is full)
#   mini-rares                     -> Distro Two
#   boss tokens                    -> Boss tokens container
#   tax items, legendary T8 maps   -> NCO main
#   raw resources                  -> NCO resources
#   unidentified magic items       -> recycler
#
# Before the first run, set the serials below and check them with
# CheckContainers.razor.
###########################################################################

@clearignore

### CONTAINERS ###
# Get a serial with >info in game. Set 0 to target the chest when the script runs.
# Stand where every chest is within 2 tiles of you, with an item recycler nearby.

# Distro One: main boss loot. Opened at the end so you can hand it out.
@setvar! CFC_DistroOne 0x4630999E

# Distro Two: mini-rares, and the loot for Distro One when One is full.
@setvar! CFC_DistroTwo 0x40FD50C6

# CFC Public Chest: members drop their boss loot here. The script empties it.
@setvar! CFC_PublicChest 0x583561C4

# NCO main: guild storage for tax items and legendary T8 maps.
# The NCO resources chest and the rune tome must be inside it.
@setvar! CFC_NCOmain 0x4F59860E

# NCO resources: inside NCO main, gets raw food, leather, ingots, boards and seeds.
@setvar! CFC_NCOresources 0x4871BAC2

# Rune tome: inside NCO main. 0 = look for a rune tome with hue 2085.
@setvar! CFC_RuneTome 0x42CBB047

# Boss tokens: inside NCO main or within 2 tiles. 0 = tokens go to NCO main.
@setvar! CFC_Tokens 0x42244475

### OPTIONS ###
# 1 = put arcane runes into the rune tome
@setvar! storeArcaneRunes 0

# 1 = empty the recycler when it is full
@setvar! autoRecycle 1

# 1 = at the end: move tax items and resources out of the distros, take runes
#     out of the CFC Public Chest and start [bossresults
@setvar! verify 1

# 1 = treat leather as distro loot (for testing)
@setvar! debug 0

# 1 = your character warns in chat that the script is being tested (temporary)
@setvar! testAnnounce 1

### TAX ###
# Tax items are kept by the guild in NCO main instead of being handed out.
# Arcane essence and mastery chain links are always taxed (see taxList).
# 1 = tax master crafting diagrams, 0 = hand them out (Distro One)
@setvar! taxMCDs 0

# 1 = tax pink arcane scrolls, 0 = hand them out (Distro Two)
@setvar! taxPinkScrolls 0

# 1 = tax research materials, 0 = hand them out (Distro One)
@setvar! taxRMs 0

sysmsg 'CFC BOSS LOOT DROP-OFF v1.0 started' 44
if testAnnounce = 1
    say 'Testing drop off script, please use bottom distro if needed'
endif

### ITEM LISTS ###

